OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment approves #220m flood
OL,4,Aalleviation scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has approved the
OL,7,Fbusiness case for a project designed to
OL,8,Freduce the risk of flooding in Oxford.
OL,10,FThe Oxford Flood Alleviation Scheme was
OL,11,Finitially expected to cost #176m, but
OL,12,Fthe Environment Agency (EA) said it had
OL,13,Fagreed to a #220m deal with contractor
OL,14,FGRAHAM.
OL,16,FIt will create a new route for
OL,17,Ffloodwater west of Oxford, storing it
OL,18,Fin deepened flood meadows and keeping
OL,19,Fit away from at-risk areas like Botley
OL,20,Fand Abingdon Road.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
